//! tr kodlu 3 dil=en
// Error 02 — A name was expected.
// Message code: H0100
// What happens: The program does not run at all; the message says that something else was found where a name was expected.
// Why: After var the name of the variable to define must follow.
// Fixed version:
//     var number = 5
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/02_syntax_name_expected.tr   (exit code 1)

TR_kw_var = 5
